          %title Atoms
          %blockquote
            %p
              This article is on the mathematical concept of atom as used in the theory of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/preorder"} preorders
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/atomic+object"} atomic object
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/atom+%28disambiguation%29"} atom (disambiguation)
